<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32681" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπληρ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fill up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκατὸν ἐχίδναις ἀσπίδ᾽ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1135
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make up</i> to a certain number, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπληροῦσι τὰς ἴσας μυριάδας
					ἐκείνοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.186
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεπληροῦτο τὸ ναυτικὸν ἐς
					τὰς..τριηκοσίας ναῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.82
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέκατον ἐκπληρῶν ὄχον</span>
			<i>making up the number of</i> ten chariots, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				708
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τοὺς ἱππέας εἰς δισχιλίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					5.3.24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>man completely,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριήρεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1327b14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>fulfil,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ χάρις ἐκπεπλήρωται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.144
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῖραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαγγελίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					13.33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>pay off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χρέος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					958b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λιμένα πλάτῃ</span>”
				<i>make one's way over,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					54
				</span></i>
			.</div>
